  {
   "etapa": "explicar",
   "piezas": [
    {
     "tipo": "explicacion",
     "titulo": "Impersonal «si»",
     "texto": [
      "**In Italia si mangia bene** (in Italy people eat well): it talks about people in general and the verb stays singular.",
      "It is common with intransitive verbs or when no patient object is stated."
     ],
     "tutora": ""
    },
    {
     "tipo": "explicacion",
     "titulo": "Passive «si»",
     "texto": [
      "**Qui si vendono libri** (books are sold here): **libri** is the patient subject and the verb agrees in the plural. With a singular noun: **si vende un libro**.",
      "A passive with an agent can use **venire**: **I biglietti vengono controllati** (the tickets are checked)."
     ],
     "tutora": ""
    },
    {
